<alcuin. carm. 115.1>	Hic deus omnipotens Adam de pulvere plasmat.
<alcuin. carm. 115.2>	Accola hic factus paradisi primitus Adam.
<alcuin. carm. 115.3>	Nomina pone, pater, cunctis animantibus Adam.
<alcuin. carm. 115.4>	Costa viri matrem pausante protulit Adam
<alcuin. carm. 115.5>	Hic seducta fuit mulier, seductus et Adam.
<alcuin. carm. 115.6>	Has, cherubim, portas flammis defende beatas.
<alcuin. carm. 115.7>	Perge foras, Adam, et felicia regna relinque.
<alcuin. carm. 115.8>	Terra tibi tribulos pro crimine germinet, Adam.
<alcuin. carm. 115.9>	Livor edax fratris hic iustum perculit Abel.
<alcuin. carm. 115.10>	Hic Noe dilectus domino sibi fabricat arcam.
<alcuin. carm. 115.11>	En natat in liquidis mundi cum civibus arca.
<alcuin. carm. 115.12>	Ecce columba pia pacis tibi portat olivam.
<alcuin. carm. 115.13>	Alba columba redit corvo pereunte nigello.
<alcuin. carm. 115.14>	Perge foras, educ et cuncta animalia tecum.
<alcuin. carm. 115.15>	Est pater hic Abram patriam dimittere iussus.
<alcuin. carm. 115.16>	Hic Sarra latitans casulae post ostia risit.
